--- !u!114 &1012176930
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1012176929}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b78d2b2643066bd4c8dab4033ce5dbd6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KineticEnergy.Level.MergedEconomyController
  currentVariant: 4
  autoMaxEnergy: 0
  comboBaseRefund: 1
  comboStepPerLevel: 0.05
  comboWindowSeconds: 3
  comboMaxMultiplier: 2
  comboMeterDropPixels: 20
  comboMeterColor: {r: 1, g: 0.62, b: 0.1, a: 1}
  comboIdleColor: {r: 0.55, g: 0.55, b: 0.55, a: 0.9}
  firstLaunchBaseRefund: 0.9
  firstLaunchStepPerLevel: 0.05
  midairLaunchBaseRefund: 0.9
  midairLaunchStepPerLevel: 0.05
  dualSafetyTriggerFraction: 0.1
  dualSafetyCeilingFraction: 0.4
  totalLossBaseRefund: 1
  totalLossStepPerLevel: 0.1
  totalLossSafetyTriggerFraction: 0.1
  totalLossSafetyCeilingFraction: 0.4
  introKey: level1challenge
  introText: 'HOW THIS LEVEL''S ENERGY WORKS


    Only the merged E economy runs
    here - no variant switching, and midair launches

    always carry the velocity
    you aimed with (momentum launches).


    THE METER: the first 4 blocks (40%)
    are normal energy. The 6 taller blocks are

    BOOSTED energy - only combo bonuses
    and the ground-pound boost can fill them.


    COMBOS: a landed launch refunds
    (first launch + midair relaunches) x the combo

    multiplier, capped at the
    energy you started the flight with. Relaunch within the

    window to raise
    the multiplier - the circle by the combo bar always shows what

    your next
    landing pays (grey while no chain runs). Landing back on the object you

    launched
    from pays nothing.


    MISS THE WINDOW and your energy reverts to 40% - everything
    boosted is lost.


    RECHARGE: below 10%, standing still slowly refills you
    to 40% (fresh energy shows

    orange, then banks yellow). Completely empty
    = you cannot launch.


    WALLS: a launch from a wall or another object counts
    as carrying at least a 40%

    launch''s speed - more if your previous launch
    was stronger.


    GROUND POUND: pound the ground and aim within the slow-mo
    window - the pound pays

    back 1.5x what you put in, and it can fill the boosted
    blocks.


    Reach the finish to win.


    Press any button to start.'
  safetyTriggerFraction: 0.1
  safetyCeilingFraction: 0.4
  regenPerSecond: 0.12
  regenOrangeFadeSeconds: 0.4
  wallLaunchStakeFraction: 0.25
  premiumBoundaryFraction: 0.4
  lockSettings: 1
  momentumLaunches: 1
  totalLossKeepFraction: 0.4
  showHudTag: 0
  flightSettleSeconds: 0.25
